{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgsufsQmkAwGPb6Gxr8a9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The pattern is almost always the lone stone sitting along the edge next to e (73 of 74). I'll build one unit per edge point covering both along-edge directions. It fires when the inward neighbour is an opponent stone, one along-edge neighbour is my lone stone and the other is opponent or empty. It is weighted so that connecting through a point with an empty neighbour, or connecting a non-lone chain, never fires. There's no capture exemption: these shapes are self-ataris or fake captures far more often than real ones. I'll use the 16 most frequent edge points, then run a paired test against v8E.\n\n```python\nsrc=open('/work/build8e.py').read()\nsrc=src.replace(\"\"\"    Q['_corn']=CORN\"\"\",\"\"\"    for e in Q['edge_pts']:\n        if u>=512: break\n        along=[x for x in NB[e] if line(x)==0]; D=[x for x in NB[e] if line(x)!=0][0]\n        for x in along:\n            W[OWN+x,u]+=2; W[OPP+x,u]+=1\n            for q in NB[x]:\n                if q!=e: W[OWN+q,u]-=3\n        W[OPP+D,u]+=2; W[OWN+D,u]-=4\n        b[u]=-4\n        CORN.append((u,e)); u+=1\n    Q['_corn']=CORN\"\"\")\nopen('/work/build8g.py','w').write(src)\nexec(src)\nedge_pts=[45*0+53,54,4,36,75,74,18,26,2,78,5,79,63,77,27,44]\nprint([divmod(x,9) for x in edge_pts], all(line(x)==0 for x in edge_pts), len(set(edge_pts)))\nPE=dict(t1=2.5,W_o=0.3,prior={0:-2.0,1:1.3,2:1.5,3:0.7,4:0.9},prior_late={0:-1.0,1:0.4,2:0.55,3:0.35,4:0.35})\nPG=dict(PE); PG['edge_pts']=edge_pts\nT=build(PG)\nexec(open('/work/build8e.py').read())\nTE=build(PE)\nprint({k:float(np.abs(T[k]-TE[k]).max()) for k in T})\nprint('units used', int((np.abs(T['L6.W']).sum(0)>0).sum()+ (np.abs(T['L6.b'])>0)[ (np.abs(T['L6.W']).sum(0)==0)].sum()))\nfor k,v in T.items(): save(k,v)\nprint('saved v8G')\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1245,"cache_read_input_tokens":479437,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1245},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fea22f52-dc2f-44b9-a9cd-4bab4d2abe73","uuid":"31f36f71-1df5-4b9b-a7c4-323f1f30d921","timestamp":"2026-11-09T19:30:42.507Z","request_id":"req_011CgsufpqjeT8qAiNMxQvYC"}
